sequenceDiagram
    participant Op as Operator
    participant S as Source manager
    participant T as Target manager
    participant SN as Source netd / anchor
    participant TN as Target netd / anchor
    Op->>Op: Validate source / target / claims / active migration
    Op->>TN: Render standby anchor Pod / wait for netd readiness
    Op->>T: Create target Pod + empty identity PVC + config
    T->>S: Exact-VM mTLS hello
    S-->>T: Machine / identity / disk offer
    T->>TN: Request prepared standby TAP descriptors
    TN->>SN: Authenticated scoped conntrack precopy
    T-->>S: Ready with incoming QEMU
    S->>T: QEMU RAM/device/identity state stream
    S->>SN: At final pause: forward stragglers
    S->>T: Activate target NIC
    T->>TN: Activate Cilium endpoint
    T-->>S: Activation acknowledged
    S->>SN: Source endpoint standby
    S->>T: Continue / finish QEMU transfer
    TN->>SN: Conntrack delta pull
    S-->>Op: Source exits cleanly as migrated
    Op->>Op: Adopt target UID / state claim / placement
    Op->>SN: Retire old anchor after forwarding grace
